            <ArticleTitle>New approaches to preventing and treating postoperative pain.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>26-34</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Dental pain is estimated to account for 15 million lost U.S. work days each year. A flexible analgesic scheme, described in this report, can effectively manage acute pain so patients won't avoid dental treatment they perceive as painful.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
